Add a new file called config.ts inside the project (same level as utils, types, components).

Inside config.ts, export this object:

export const API_CONFIG = {
  TMDB_API_KEY: "4783ff92701c53c5922ec6c75b09504c",
};

Then update the tmdb helper (tmdb.ts or utils/tmdb.ts) to import API_CONFIG and use API_CONFIG.TMDB_API_KEY instead of process.env.TMDB_API_KEY.

Remove all references to process.env, and make all TMDB fetch URLs use:

https://api.themoviedb.org/3/discover/movie?api_key=${API_CONFIG.TMDB_API_KEY}&include_adult=false&language=en-US&sort_by=popularity.desc

This way the app works without a .env file and always uses the correct TMDB API key.
